    "description": "<p>This Charm upgrades Dragonfly Finds Mate. If that Charm successfully parries an attack, the Exalt can pay an extra 4m, 1wp during Step 9 to launch an unblockable, undodgeable counterattack that applies a number of successes to hit equal to the (parry successes rolled – original attack successes) in place of an attack roll. The attack otherwise uses the statistics of the Terrestrial's weapon. Using Dragonfly Finds Mate this way follows standard Dragon-Blooded Reflexive Charm rules.</p>",
